---
import Button from '../../ui/Button.astro';
---

<section class="section_home-why">
          <div class="section-gap">
            <div class="container-main">
              <div class="home-why-wrapper">
                <div class="section-header">
                  <div class="section-header-title-block">
                    <div class="section-eyebrow">
                      <div class="section-eyebrow-icon w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                          <path d="M10 0C10.75 6.25 13.75 9.25 20 10C13.75 10.75 10.75 13.75 10 20C9.25 13.75 6.25 10.75 0 10C6.25 9.25 9.25 6.25 10 0Z" fill="currentColor"></path>
                        </svg></div>
                      <div class="section-eyebrow-label">Why Arcline</div>
                    </div>
                    <h2 class="heading-style-2 section-header-heading">Strategy From Insight to Impact</h2>
                    <div class="section-header-doodle is-pos-why w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 45 50" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                        <path d="M2 27C3.3557 18.4591 6.90298 10.3881 9 2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                        <path d="M17.5 32C25.9926 27.1537 34.4984 22.3305 43 17.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                        <path d="M19.8228 47.1832C26.5813 47.234 33.3158 47.9922 40.048 47.9922" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="section-header-summary-block">
                    <p class="text-size-regular">Four principles guide every engagement — so recommendations are grounded, owned by your team, and built to last beyond our involvement.</p>
                    <Button href="/contact-v1" variant="dark">Start a Conversation</Button>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="home-why-grid">
                  <div class="home-why-media"><img src="/images/home-why-consultant.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/home-why-consultant-p-500.webp 500w, /images/home-why-consultant-p-800.webp 800w, /images/home-why-consultant-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/home-why-consultant.webp 1340w" alt="Smiling Arcline consultant with arms crossed in a bright office" class="home-why-image" />
                    <div class="home-why-note">
                      <div class="home-why-note-label">Arcline working principle</div>
                      <div class="home-why-note-quote">“We start with the business, not the framework.”</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="home-why-list">
                    <div class="home-why-item is-open">
                      <h3 class="home-why-heading"><button type="button" class="home-why-toggle"><span class="home-why-number is-open">01</span><span class="home-why-title is-open">Deep Industry Expertise</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="home-why-icon is-open"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="home-why-icon-plus is-open">
                              <path d="M9.99347 3.33333V9.99998M9.99347 9.99998V16.6666M9.99347 9.99998H16.6601M9.99347 9.99998H3.32682" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                            </svg><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="home-why-icon-arrow is-open">
                              <path d="M7.5 5.54194C7.5 5.54194 13.28195 5.08966 14.09616 5.90386C14.91038 6.71806 14.45803 12.5 14.45803 12.5M13.75 6.25L5.41667 14.58333" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                            </svg></span></button></h3>
                      <div class="home-why-body is-open">
                        <div class="home-why-text">
                          <p class="text-size-regular">Familiarize yourself with the business before making solution recommendations.</p>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="home-why-item">
                      <h3 class="home-why-heading"><button type="button" class="home-why-toggle"><span class="home-why-number">02</span><span class="home-why-title">Human-Centered Strategy</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="home-why-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="home-why-icon-plus">
                              <path d="M9.99347 3.33333V9.99998M9.99347 9.99998V16.6666M9.99347 9.99998H16.6601M9.99347 9.99998H3.32682" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                            </svg><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="home-why-icon-arrow">
                              <path d="M7.5 5.54194C7.5 5.54194 13.28195 5.08966 14.09616 5.90386C14.91038 6.71806 14.45803 12.5 14.45803 12.5M13.75 6.25L5.41667 14.58333" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                            </svg></span></button></h3>
                      <div class="home-why-body">
                        <div class="home-why-text">
                          <p class="text-size-regular">Design every recommendation around the people who will live with it: customers, teams and leaders.</p>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="home-why-item">
                      <h3 class="home-why-heading"><button type="button" class="home-why-toggle"><span class="home-why-number">03</span><span class="home-why-title">Data-Led Decisions</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="home-why-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="home-why-icon-plus">
                              <path d="M9.99347 3.33333V9.99998M9.99347 9.99998V16.6666M9.99347 9.99998H16.6601M9.99347 9.99998H3.32682" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                            </svg><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="home-why-icon-arrow">
                              <path d="M7.5 5.54194C7.5 5.54194 13.28195 5.08966 14.09616 5.90386C14.91038 6.71806 14.45803 12.5 14.45803 12.5M13.75 6.25L5.41667 14.58333" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                            </svg></span></button></h3>
                      <div class="home-why-body">
                        <div class="home-why-text">
                          <p class="text-size-regular">Back every choice with evidence, from market data to operational metrics, never gut feeling alone.</p>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="home-why-item">
                      <h3 class="home-why-heading"><button type="button" class="home-why-toggle"><span class="home-why-number">04</span><span class="home-why-title">Execution Focused</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="home-why-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="home-why-icon-plus">
                              <path d="M9.99347 3.33333V9.99998M9.99347 9.99998V16.6666M9.99347 9.99998H16.6601M9.99347 9.99998H3.32682" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                            </svg><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="home-why-icon-arrow">
                              <path d="M7.5 5.54194C7.5 5.54194 13.28195 5.08966 14.09616 5.90386C14.91038 6.71806 14.45803 12.5 14.45803 12.5M13.75 6.25L5.41667 14.58333" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                            </svg></span></button></h3>
                      <div class="home-why-body">
                        <div class="home-why-text">
                          <p class="text-size-regular">Plan for delivery from day one, with clear owners, milestones and measures that make change stick.</p>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
